    "hypothesis": {
      "id": "admissible_forest_aggregate_in_the_hard_regime",
      "statement": "The aggregate sum_{c in A} L(c) <= 2 R m survives inside the near-Fekete shell, where it is tight, and the degenerate-hub under-report of the branch integrator does not reach that shell."
